id: glass-shards-fifth-effect
name: 5th effect of Glass Shards
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: glass-shards
fromEffect: 5
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Glass Shards' fifth effect, as a Maneuver: a Shard Carrier picked - an Out-of-Sequence Basic Attack of the Glass Profile at them.
text: >
  (5)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, select a Shard Carrier. Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you must select the Glass Profile for that Attacking Maneuver and that Attacking Maneuver must include your selected Shard Carrier as a target. After concluding that Attacking Maneuver, that Character stops being a Shard Carrier.

---

# The Liquid State's sixth effect's shape: owned by every character, in the list only while Glass Shards is had. Used, a
# Shard Carrier picked (chat.mjs shardStrike).
[on used]
shardStrike();
